{"title":"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems\">2013 AMC 12B #5</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2013 AMC 10B Problems\">2013 AMC 10B #6</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The average age of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/f/b6f3bccae16d5e31266370fced24edc41538d5da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$33$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> fifth-graders is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. The average age of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/9/b79030abeb688469b5ffc2e1c4e37fee225a529e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$55$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> of their parents is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/f/b6f3bccae16d5e31266370fced24edc41538d5da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$33$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />. What is the average age of all of these parents and fifth-graders?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/3/ad3e5a1473047ea23f5ee22efe3c215dca74d19a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 22 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 23.25 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 24.75 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 26.25 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"466\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of the ages of the fifth graders is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/f/a5f218f469819b421a08bd78803c925c67beb862.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$33 * 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" />, while the sum of the ages of the parents is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/f/90f68c7c3cf0745f9a309199c56e4219bba89cfd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$55 * 33$\" width=\"53\" height=\"12\" />. Therefore, the total sum of all their ages must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/d/2edde2ab3c1980467a20a22d1e6f980f91e8d62b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2178$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" />, and given <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/f/0ff56ff939af69c05034e731a55db507fca772db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$33 + 55 = 88$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"100\" height=\"14\" /> people in total, their average age is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/9/589df7163053ab31a550f9a6d57d2cee4d8fba4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2178}{88} = \\frac{99}{4} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 24.75}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"198\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a h